{"version":1,"content":"<p>由大澳文化協會與大澳文物酒店合辦、香港歷史文物保育建設贊助的「2026大澳搖櫓夜彩遊」，今年已踏入第三年，在 9 月 25 日、27 日、10 月 1 日、3 日都有活動，要預先報名。活動中，舢舨以象徵大澳昔日漁業興盛的「黃唇魚」限定魚燈作點綴。參加者丁口乘坐傳統手工搖櫓舢舨，由資深「櫓友」掌舵，在晚上漫遊水鄉，沿途細聽水鄉風情與百年漁村故事。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"605\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9302-20260927yik-YIK_5510_2a-1024x605.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9303-20260927yik-YIK_5734_1a-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"703\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9304-20260927yik-YIK_5345_2a-1024x703.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"672\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9305-20260927yik-YIK_5285_1a-1024x672.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"665\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9306-20260927yik-IMG_1776a-1024x665.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"692\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9307-20260927yik-YIK_5331_1a-1024x692.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9308-20260927yik-YIK_5401_4a-1024x682.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E6%90%96%E6%AB%9309-202609